#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Pauli propagation {#pauli-propagation}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `pauli-prop` package provides a Rust-accelerated Python interface for "
"performing Pauli propagation.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Pauli propagation is a framework for approximating the evolution of "
"operators in the Pauli basis under the action of other operators, such as "
"quantum circuit gates and noise channels. This approach can be effective "
"when the operators involved are expected to remain sparse in the Pauli "
"basis.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The subroutines in this package may be used to implement error mitigation "
"techniques such as [lightcone shading](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc) "
"[\\[6\\]](#references) and [propagated noise absorption](/addons/qiskit-"
"addon-pna) [\\[7\\]](#references), [operator "
"backpropagation](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp) [\\[8\\]](#references) for "
"circuit depth reduction, and classical simulation of expectation values "
"[\\[1-5\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""

