#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use case examples {#use-case-examples}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Pauli propagation can be used as a lower-level engine to implement a variety"
" of techniques. Some examples of where this has been used are:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Lightcone shading to reduce the sampling overhead of probabilistic error "
"cancellation (PEC) for mitigating expectation values in a 1- and 2D "
"transverse field Ising model [\\[6\\]](#references) \\[`qiskit-addon-slc` "
"[docs](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc)]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Absorbing noise model information into a target observable to mitigate "
"expectation values in a 2D transverse field Ising model "
"[\\[7\\]](#references) \\[`qiskit-addon-pna` [docs](/addons/qiskit-addon-"
"pna)]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Trimming trailing gates to produce lower-depth Trotter circuits for the "
"time-evolution of a 2D spin model [\\[8\\]](#references) \\[`qiskit-addon-"
"obp` [docs](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp)]\n"
msgstr ""

